values
  ('bhojana_vidhi', 7, 'pradhana', null, null, 'Pranahuti', 'ப்ராணாஹுதி',
   'With the thumb, middle and ring fingers take a little food, and swallow it as each line is said.',
   'கட்டைவிரல், நடுவிரல், மோதிர விரல்களால் சிறிது உணவு எடுத்து, ஒவ்வொரு வரியையும் சொல்லி விழுங்கவும்.',
   null,
   null,
   null,
   'To prana, svaha; to apana, svaha; to vyana, svaha; to udana, svaha; to samana, svaha; to Brahman, svaha.',
   'Six small offerings, and the fire they go into is the body''s own: the five breaths that keep it alive, and Brahman after them. The meal begins as a homa in which the eater is the altar.',
